WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.570
(ethereal instrumental music)

00:00:02.570 --> 00:00:04.360
- We're about to head into the
Microsoft press conference.

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:06.520
There is going to be a
showcase event right after

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.443
where there will be food
and drinks and game capture.

00:00:08.443 --> 00:00:11.420
That sounds like the
most perfect event to me.

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:13.050
I'm hoping there's
gonna be some surprises.

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:14.618
There's been some rumors going around

00:00:14.618 --> 00:00:16.770
that they do have some surprises.

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:17.760
And you know what I like?

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:18.940
I like surprises.

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:20.503
So let's go get surprised.

00:00:20.503 --> 00:00:22.277
Ed, what are you laughing about?

00:00:22.277 --> 00:00:23.966
What are you laughing?

00:00:23.966 --> 00:00:25.510
- Because you got real
creepy on surprises.

00:00:25.510 --> 00:00:26.427
- Surprises.

00:00:26.427 --> 00:00:29.250
- I like surprises.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.260
Let's go get surprised.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:32.210
I'm surprised.

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:34.610
Guys, this is my buddy, this is my friend.

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:35.691
I'm so excited to see you.

00:00:35.691 --> 00:00:36.524
It is so good to see you.

00:00:36.524 --> 00:00:37.480
- Oh, I'm so excited to see you.

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:38.570
What was our first time?

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:41.073
Was it, it was at the game awards.

00:00:41.073 --> 00:00:41.906
- It was the game awards.

00:00:41.906 --> 00:00:43.565
When we presented...

00:00:43.565 --> 00:00:46.290
- Four years ago, for
John Bing, rest in peace.

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:48.130
I'm so glad we got to do that.

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:49.340
I'm so glad I got to do that with you.

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:50.980
His memory is kind of alive right here.

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:52.446
- It really was, that was
such a special moment too.

00:00:52.446 --> 00:00:54.214
And just to be able to do that.

00:00:54.214 --> 00:00:55.100
And that was the first time we met,

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:57.646
and we had such a fun time,
like, just chatting about games

00:00:57.646 --> 00:01:00.870
and being friends and
now you've come so far.

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:01.751
- Yes!

00:01:01.751 --> 00:01:03.450
- Guys, this is crazy. How much
weight have you lost so far?

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:05.450
- I've lost exactly two of you.

00:01:05.450 --> 00:01:07.000
- Oh my goodness.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:07.833
But that's amazing,

00:01:07.833 --> 00:01:10.204
and I'm just so happy to
see you doing so well.

00:01:10.204 --> 00:01:11.037
- Thank you.

00:01:11.037 --> 00:01:11.870
- And you made it to E3.

00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:13.700
- And I'm able to walk
around, and I'm able to move,

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:15.630
and I'm able to do stuff.

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:16.463
- It's so exciting.

00:01:16.463 --> 00:01:17.296
- Can I get a hug?

00:01:17.296 --> 00:01:18.260
- Yes of course. You're the best.

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:20.760
Anything that you're
really looking forward to

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:21.880
this year at E3?

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:22.713
What's your highlight?

00:01:22.713 --> 00:01:24.340
- I'm hoping to get to
play the Anthem demo.

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:25.828
I'm super excited to try it.

00:01:25.828 --> 00:01:28.540
I'm really excited to see
what Microsoft has in store.

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:30.310
I'm hoping they've got a few surprises.

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:31.830
- I think they do, that's what I've heard.

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:33.050
I like surprises.

00:01:33.050 --> 00:01:35.670
- And if I can, I just need five minutes

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:38.130
alone with Smash 'cause I have to see

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:39.960
if it's as good as I hope it's gonna be.

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:42.300
And I know it's almost
impossible to get in line.

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:43.133
Even to see it.

00:01:43.133 --> 00:01:44.073
I know you'll get to play it, probably.

00:01:44.073 --> 00:01:46.870
I just need to know if Pacman
got brought over to this one.

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:49.131
If Pacman's in this one, it's
gonna be the best Smash ever.

00:01:49.131 --> 00:01:50.830
- I hope so, but I can't wait.

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:52.700
Well, I'm excited for
you, I'm excited for E3.

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:53.533
- I'm so excited.

00:01:53.533 --> 00:01:55.980
- So here we go. E3, 2018 starts now.

00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:56.940
We're heading over to Microsoft.

00:01:56.940 --> 00:01:57.773
- Let's go have fun.

00:01:57.773 --> 00:01:58.880
- Okay, yay!

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:01.760
(bouncy upbeat music)

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:03.563
This is it, let's get a seat.

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:07.200
So when we walked in the
first thing that I noticed

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:10.490
is all of these consoles on the stage.

00:02:10.490 --> 00:02:12.357
Do you think this is some
sort of Battle Royale?

00:02:12.357 --> 00:02:13.840
- [Ed] Oooh.

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:15.650
- [Justine] Have you guys
heard about Battle Royale?

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:17.040
- Maybe there's going to be 100 people

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:19.110
on stage playing one game.

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:20.474
What's that even like?

00:02:20.474 --> 00:02:22.013
- [Justine] I don't know.

00:02:22.013 --> 00:02:24.430
(epic music)

00:02:26.083 --> 00:02:28.666
- We are all shook to the core.

00:02:30.579 --> 00:02:33.579
(Presenter talking)

00:02:36.814 --> 00:02:39.231
(epic music)

00:02:40.352 --> 00:02:43.352
(audience cheering)

00:02:44.453 --> 00:02:45.580
- He's actually crying.

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:47.602
- I'm already crying.

00:02:47.602 --> 00:02:49.760
(audience cheering)

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:53.129
- Now, we are bringing
the Fallout universe

00:02:53.129 --> 00:02:58.037
to X class gamepass with
Fallout 4 launching today.

00:02:58.887 --> 00:03:01.887
(Presenter talking)

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:08.340
(audience cheering)

00:03:12.737 --> 00:03:14.862
- Walls are just buildings.

00:03:14.862 --> 00:03:19.112
but hearts, minds, and,
ultimately, America itself.

00:03:20.845 --> 00:03:23.262
(epic music)

00:03:30.527 --> 00:03:32.173
(audience cheering)

00:03:32.173 --> 00:03:35.840
- Forza Farmville means
Forza Battle Royale.

00:03:40.586 --> 00:03:42.195
Ralph, let's talk about it.

00:03:42.195 --> 00:03:43.086
- [Narrator] Dynamic seasons

00:03:43.086 --> 00:03:43.919
- Farm!

00:03:43.919 --> 00:03:45.071
- Farm.

00:03:45.071 --> 00:03:49.090
- In a shared open world. And
seasons change everything.

00:03:52.408 --> 00:03:54.800
(Game trailer playing)

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:56.760
- [Woman] So you guys are coming or what?

00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:57.593
Yeah.

00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:00.640
- We just got out of the press conference,

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:03.810
and I'm with Ed and Faruk,
and what do we think?

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:04.770
Who wants to go first?

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:06.080
Ed cried.

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:08.545
I couldn't see if you
were crying, I saw Ed cry.

00:04:08.545 --> 00:04:10.130
- I want to apologize for screaming

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:12.974
when they announced Cyberpunk 2077.

00:04:12.974 --> 00:04:15.453
(typing)

00:04:15.453 --> 00:04:16.286
- Yeah.

00:04:16.286 --> 00:04:17.119
- Yes!

00:04:18.222 --> 00:04:20.855
Yes!

00:04:20.855 --> 00:04:21.688
Oh my God.

00:04:23.520 --> 00:04:24.427
Oh my God.

00:04:30.820 --> 00:04:32.683
- I've never seen Ed this happy ever.

00:04:35.862 --> 00:04:37.480
- I've been waiting for that
game for like eight years,

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:38.990
and I don't think anybody
really knew about it.

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:41.260
I thought it was like
another Watch Dogs thing,

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:42.900
because the way everything
was getting hacked and stuff.

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:44.530
And they said the year was 2077,

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:45.610
and they hadn't said the game yet,

00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:47.810
and I stood up and screamed,
and I scared everybody.

00:04:47.810 --> 00:04:49.902
- You scared me.

00:04:49.902 --> 00:04:50.735
- Yes.

00:04:51.802 --> 00:04:53.050
- Fallout, you hyped for that?

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:54.867
- I couldn't be more hyped for Fallout.

00:04:54.867 --> 00:04:57.960
They showed more, but then
tonight we see even more

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:59.950
so I'm excited to see
some gameplay hopefully.

00:04:59.950 --> 00:05:01.970
- Well, it was kinda
crazy 'cause they really

00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:03.950
just went all in, like at the beginning.

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:06.150
They were like "Hey,
what's up? Halo Infinite."

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:07.390
I've been to a bunch of
press conferences before

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:09.470
but I've never seen a standing ovation

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:11.040
at the very beginning.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.073
That was wild.

00:05:12.073 --> 00:05:14.949
That was Halo Infinite, and there's this.

00:05:14.949 --> 00:05:18.116
Everybody is standing up and cheering.

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:21.050
Do you have any highlights?

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:23.360
- Dying light 2 was amazing.

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:26.220
Little known information: in Dying light 1

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:29.980
there's this one scene, and
the person in that scene

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:33.424
has the same first name
and last name as me.

00:05:33.424 --> 00:05:34.257
- What?

00:05:34.257 --> 00:05:37.305
- So people send that
clip to me all the time.

00:05:37.305 --> 00:05:38.138
- No way!

00:05:38.138 --> 00:05:40.660
- I also liked Forza,
that looked really good.

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:43.371
I love car racing simulations.

00:05:43.371 --> 00:05:47.800
Grip and the way the car handles
changes with the seasons.

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:50.090
- The conditions on the roads
are different every time.

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:51.743
Like wet leaves and stuff like that.

00:05:51.743 --> 00:05:52.770
That looked pretty awesome.

00:05:52.770 --> 00:05:53.930
- I was just thinking back to Destiny,

00:05:53.930 --> 00:05:55.675
every time we would see an
event incoming or something,

00:05:55.675 --> 00:05:58.500
we would be racing, but then sometimes

00:05:58.500 --> 00:05:59.560
I'd be going to the wrong event,

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:00.640
and Ed would be at another event,

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:02.501
and Jenna's eating pizza or eating chips,

00:06:02.501 --> 00:06:03.334
and I'm like "What are you eating?"

00:06:03.334 --> 00:06:05.640
- Or in a cave, just hiding for a while.

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:06.473
- Yeah.

00:06:06.473 --> 00:06:08.280
Man, we had so much fun playing Destiny.

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:10.757
Every time we eat Doritos,
I just think about Destiny.

00:06:10.757 --> 00:06:12.140
(laughter)

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:14.260
- I think about how your
controller's still clean,

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:15.860
but your thumbs were so orange.

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:19.880
So hats off to Microsoft
on the white thumb sticks.

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:21.540
- 2018 E3 is here.

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:22.750
It has just begun.

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:24.620
I don't know what's happening
next but stay tuned.

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:28.370
I mobile ordered this
from the press conference.

00:06:32.475 --> 00:06:34.558
Oh, there's some friends.

00:06:35.461 --> 00:06:37.034
Hello!

00:06:37.034 --> 00:06:38.670
- Those reactions.

00:06:38.670 --> 00:06:41.560
- We've met up with some wild friends.

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:43.940
Were you guys at the E3?

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:45.543
- We were at the E3, yes.

00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:50.010
- We were at D3, which is
a whole different thing.

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:52.260
- Do you guys have any highlights?

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:53.260
- Anime fighting game.

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:54.255
- All about it.

00:06:54.255 --> 00:06:56.034
- Battletoes.

00:06:56.034 --> 00:06:57.240
- Were you the one that yelled?

00:06:57.240 --> 00:06:59.674
Okay, I heard that.

00:06:59.674 --> 00:07:00.854
- It was me or him.

00:07:00.854 --> 00:07:02.825
- I heard screaming.

00:07:02.825 --> 00:07:03.658
- Battleboys.

00:07:03.658 --> 00:07:06.480
- It was so funny to hear the most random,

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:08.770
just little pits of the audience screaming

00:07:08.770 --> 00:07:09.603
for certain things.

00:07:09.603 --> 00:07:10.730
Like Ed stood up

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:13.505
and was crying about
Cyberpunk, like screaming.

00:07:13.505 --> 00:07:14.571
- Of course.

00:07:14.571 --> 00:07:16.550
- [Justine] Screaming!

00:07:16.550 --> 00:07:17.740
- Eight years I've been waiting for that.

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:19.560
- Oh my God, it's perfect.

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:20.750
- It was great.

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:21.583
Yeah, wow.

00:07:21.583 --> 00:07:22.416
Wow, so we're here.

00:07:22.416 --> 00:07:23.760
Can you believe E3's here again?

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:24.593
- I know.

00:07:24.593 --> 00:07:26.117
Almost feels like VidCon right now

00:07:26.117 --> 00:07:26.950
looking down at the line.

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:29.540
- [Justine] Oh my gosh.

00:07:29.540 --> 00:07:30.990
- [Man] Everybody from YouTube in one.

00:07:30.990 --> 00:07:33.140
- [Justine] This is
like the YouTube squad.

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:39.310
We're super excited, we're about
to get our game capture on.

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:40.860
This is the Microsoft showcase event,

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:43.000
it's after the press conference,

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:45.320
and Nick is walking backwards right now.

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:48.339
He's gonna fall, he's
definitely gonna fall.

00:07:48.339 --> 00:07:51.422
(epic dubstep music)

00:07:55.710 --> 00:07:57.410
Somebody's gonna do some shopping.

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:00.297
Spoiler alert: me.

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:02.740
Okay, but do you guys remember

00:08:02.740 --> 00:08:04.340
when I got the chocolate lancer?

00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:07.059
Do you guys remember that?

00:08:07.059 --> 00:08:08.500
(unwrapping)

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:10.143
How many calories do you think?

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:12.963
Let's not think.

00:08:14.849 --> 00:08:18.516
(powerful electronic music)

00:08:21.599 --> 00:08:23.093
So we just figured out
what all of those Xboxes

00:08:23.093 --> 00:08:25.990
were on the stage for, it was
for this particular moment

00:08:25.990 --> 00:08:28.100
that we're about to enjoy right now.

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:29.233
Game capture.

00:08:31.480 --> 00:08:33.020
Got my little hard drive.

00:08:33.020 --> 00:08:34.170
This is how we capture.

00:08:35.508 --> 00:08:37.000
We've got Forza,

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:39.800
we've got copywritten
music playing as always.

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:41.210
Why do you guys do this?

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:43.656
The Adaptive Controller.

00:08:43.656 --> 00:08:44.863
So this is something

00:08:44.863 --> 00:08:45.930
I'm really, really excited about.

00:08:45.930 --> 00:08:47.890
This was actually
announced a few weeks ago.

00:08:47.890 --> 00:08:49.757
It's the Xbox Adaptive Controller,

00:08:49.757 --> 00:08:51.060
and this is really incredible,

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:53.140
and I'm so excited to learn more about it.

00:08:53.140 --> 00:08:55.240
And it was amazing to
see all of the tweets

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:56.970
and the amazing response of the community

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:57.850
to this controller.

00:08:57.850 --> 00:08:59.166
This is gonna help so many people,

00:08:59.166 --> 00:09:00.833
and I'm so excited to see how

00:09:00.833 --> 00:09:02.733
this will change the game for so many.

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:07.140
Alright, I didn't wanna pick
that car but I picked it.

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:07.973
Shoot.

00:09:07.973 --> 00:09:08.834
Can I cancel?

00:09:08.834 --> 00:09:09.667
Can I go back?

00:09:09.667 --> 00:09:10.890
Nope, this is what we got.

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:12.427
We've got a McLaren Senna.

00:09:12.427 --> 00:09:13.633
I'm okay with that.

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:18.180
(game noises)

00:09:19.337 --> 00:09:20.170
What,

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:22.543
did I just do?

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:28.793
Oh my...

00:09:29.770 --> 00:09:30.603
We're...

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:34.723
I did so bad that they had
to remove me from the game.

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:38.090
There's a sheep.

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:38.923
There's a sheep!

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:41.173
We are now in winter.

00:09:42.750 --> 00:09:43.603
Let's get it.

00:09:46.107 --> 00:09:47.410
(fast electronic music)

00:09:47.410 --> 00:09:49.013
This music has me so hyped.

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:54.447
Get out of my way.

00:09:54.447 --> 00:09:56.993
Okay, ice is crazy to actually drive on.

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:00.263
What is happening?

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:05.005
Move.

00:10:05.930 --> 00:10:06.763
Out of the way.

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:10.133
Oh my gosh.

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:16.843
Look at this festival.

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:21.783
I'm definitely yelling.

00:10:22.638 --> 00:10:23.471
Am I yelling?

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:27.823
'Cause it's very, my
headphones are so loud.

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:30.807
We're in spring now.

00:10:32.223 --> 00:10:33.747
(car engine roaring)

00:10:33.747 --> 00:10:34.580
Noooooo.

00:10:36.247 --> 00:10:37.812
Woohooo.

00:10:37.812 --> 00:10:39.803
Woooow... Wow.

00:10:41.430 --> 00:10:44.433
You just got jacked up.

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:51.723
Are we going into summer now?

00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:53.560
Let's get it.

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:55.880
- [Narrator] This is it, Horizon.

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:57.630
We are kicking off the summer season

00:10:57.630 --> 00:10:59.953
with the greatest race of all time.

00:11:00.854 --> 00:11:01.820
Oh yeah.

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:04.403
- Where did you guys come from?

00:11:06.304 --> 00:11:07.221
Watch this.

00:11:08.092 --> 00:11:09.299
See that?

00:11:09.299 --> 00:11:12.081
That was impeccable passing.

00:11:12.081 --> 00:11:13.029
What?

00:11:13.029 --> 00:11:15.110
They're Ori cookies.

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:16.532
